WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.523 --> 00:00:17.802
- Good evening everybody
and welcome to our Seder.

00:00:17.802 --> 00:00:22.527
We wanna wish you all a very
happy fourth night of Passover.

00:00:22.527 --> 00:00:25.653
This is a holiday that
celebrates transitions.

00:00:25.653 --> 00:00:28.201
From confinement to liberation,

00:00:28.201 --> 00:00:29.881
from winter to spring,

00:00:29.881 --> 00:00:33.322
and aptly, it's a holiday
that celebrates tenacity

00:00:33.322 --> 00:00:37.009
and resilience in the times
of overwhelming adversity.

00:00:37.009 --> 00:00:38.891
Now normally, our friends
and our loved ones

00:00:38.891 --> 00:00:40.634
would gather together on this night

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.911
and would tell the ancient story

00:00:42.911 --> 00:00:46.666
and even though we are all
pretty much separated tonight,

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:49.453
it seems like this story is more timely

00:00:49.453 --> 00:00:51.248
and more important than ever.

00:00:51.248 --> 00:00:52.926
So we soldier on.

00:00:52.926 --> 00:00:55.281
Even though we can't
physically be together,

00:00:55.281 --> 00:00:59.228
we can still eat and laugh
and reflect and dream

00:00:59.228 --> 00:01:02.644
and we can do all that while
raising much-needed funds

00:01:02.644 --> 00:01:04.515
for the CDC Foundation.

00:01:04.515 --> 00:01:06.218
So please during our Seder,

00:01:06.218 --> 00:01:09.596
locate that Donate button
and give it a little click.

00:01:09.596 --> 00:01:12.031
But first, we sing.

00:01:12.031 --> 00:01:14.175
Now this is not just a sit back and relax,

00:01:14.175 --> 00:01:15.858
you actually have to recline.

00:01:15.858 --> 00:01:18.825
This is a holiday that
celebrates slouching, alright?

00:01:18.825 --> 00:01:22.780
So, welcome to our Saturday Night Seder.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:24.436
♪ We've got a lot to talk about ♪

00:01:24.436 --> 00:01:25.825
♪ And even more to eat ♪

00:01:25.825 --> 00:01:27.628
♪ Take your shoes off and your coat off ♪

00:01:27.628 --> 00:01:29.273
♪ There's there bathroom have a seat ♪

00:01:29.273 --> 00:01:31.069
♪ So you're stressed by all the stories ♪

00:01:31.069 --> 00:01:32.761
♪ That you hear on Cable News ♪

00:01:32.761 --> 00:01:34.533
♪ Well it's time to trade the cable ♪

00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:36.543
♪ For a table full of Jews ♪

00:01:36.543 --> 00:01:38.271
(clarinet music)

00:01:38.271 --> 00:01:39.832
♪ This night is always different ♪

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:41.477
♪ From every other night ♪

00:01:41.477 --> 00:01:43.152
♪ There's a smidgen of religion ♪

00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:44.973
♪ But we're keeping that part light ♪

00:01:44.973 --> 00:01:46.496
