to have a Jewish holiday

00:08:37.796 --> 00:08:41.469
where it's based in the home
and it can be creative and fun

00:08:41.469 --> 00:08:45.552
with just kind of a loose
structure of 15 things.

00:08:46.489 --> 00:08:47.555
It's simple.

00:08:47.555 --> 00:08:49.458
- We say (speaks in foreign language)

00:08:49.458 --> 00:08:51.958
meaning next year, the year to come.

00:08:51.958 --> 00:08:54.799
There's a great song that many
of my friends and family sing

00:08:54.799 --> 00:08:57.795
