00:09:05.653 --> 00:09:08.244
Meaning, we will see, we will see

00:09:08.244 --> 00:09:10.463
just how good it will
be in the year to come

00:09:10.463 --> 00:09:11.981
although it may not feel like it now.

00:09:11.981 --> 00:09:13.512
The song always is a great reminder

00:09:13.512 --> 00:09:15.787
that there are so many good
things that are ahead of us

00:09:15.787 --> 00:09:18.204
