and that home will be
a world without fear,

01:00:07.548 --> 01:00:11.519
a world without hunger, a world
without poverty and worked.

01:00:11.519 --> 01:00:13.760
Next year, we will be in a world

01:00:13.760 --> 01:00:16.734
that is caring and supportive
of it's inhabitants

01:00:16.734 --> 01:00:18.660
and a world where it's inhabitants

01:00:18.660 --> 01:00:22.013
are caring and supportive of
the world in which they live.

01:00:22.013 --> 01:00:25.515
Next year, we will look to
our great minds for leadership

01:00:25.515 --> 01:00:27.934
and execute out mouthfuls.

01:00:27.934 --> 01:00:31.072
Next year, we will remember
the lessons of kindness

01:00:31.072 --> 01:00:32.158
from our youth.

01:00:32.158 --> 01:00:36.261
Next year, we will aspire
to live our possibilities.

01:00:36.261 --> 01:00:38.174
Next year, we will be grateful

01:00:38.174 --> 01:00:40.690
for the gift of life we've been given.

01:00:40.690 --> 01:00:44.503
Next year, we will achieve
our goals and share our bounty

01:00:44.503 --> 01:00:46.782
with family, friends, and neighbors.

01:00:46.782 --> 01:00:50.501
Next year, the word
stranger will be meaningless

01:00:50.501 --> 01:00:55.496
because next year, we will
all be together in our home.

01:00:55.496 --> 01:00:59.455
So, Next year in Jerusalem.

